  "provenance": {
    "pc_sprite_commands": "func_0810A018 walks PcSpriteCmd records until flag bit0x80; every native terminal is flag0xFF. The real struct is12 bytes (two u8 fields, four s16 fields, one u16 field). Traversing the96 independently rooted command streams yields4380 full records and exactly partitions52560 native bytes when sorted by physical start. Runtime index order is preserved separately and agrees across regions; it is not assumed to equal physical order. Every index0..95 is used by the previously owned PcAnimStep command selector field, and all command bytes are identical in US,JP,EU. Drawing uses flags, sprite selectors, layer indices and coordinates, so these are program-level command records rather than pixel payload. The96-entry pointer table ends at the separately owned PcAnimStep selector. Existing fallback name gUnk_09A3DF34 and pointer index gUnk_09EF9C34 retain canonical types and public unsized declarations."
  },
